\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Chile \highlight\uc2  cenbank says to keep up  \highlight22\uc2 forex intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 240 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 September 2008\par 23:06\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2008 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 SANTIAGO, Sept 8 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Monday it would continue as planned with an $8 billion \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  program, even though the peso has already reversed a sharp appreciation earlier in the year.\par \par \uc2 The bank said it would continue to buy $50 million worth of dollars at daily auctions, as originally envisaged when the bank launched its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  program in April to boost reserves and sap peso strength.\par \par \uc2 However, the peso closed at its weakest level since August 2007 on Monday, as news of the U.S. bailout of mortgage loan giants \uc2 Freddie Mac\uc2  and \uc2 Fannie Mae\uc2  bolstered the dollar.\par \par \uc2 The peso has weakened 5.5 percent for the year-to-date and by over 18 percent since the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  introduced the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  program in April. The bank aims to complete the purchase of $8 billion in U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  by December 12.\par \par \uc2 Chile's peso <CHILJ> <CLP=CL> fell 0.57 percent to close at 527.00/527.30 per dollar on Monday compared with 524.00/524.50 per dollar on Friday.\par \par \uc2 A \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  board member said in August that the bank had purchased $4.45 billion worth of dollars in just over four months under the program at an average price of 488.72 pesos per dollar.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 CHILE\b0 \highlight\uc2 -CENBANK/\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2 |LANGEN|ABN|D|M|E|RBN|U|RNP|DNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020080908e498001uu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
