\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Chile \highlight\uc2  Ctrl Bk Pres Says Satisfied With  \highlight22\uc2 Forex Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 206 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 Mai 2008\par 16:51\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2008 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 SANTIAGO (Dow Jones)--Chilean \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  president Jose De Gregorio said Friday the \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  is "satisfied" with its announced \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.\par \par \uc2 Last month, in a bid to weaken the peso - which was trading at 10-year highs - the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  announced it would increase its international reserves by $8 billion by the end of the year through daily purchases of $50 million.\par \par \uc2 Since the bank began its daily purchases on the local \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in mid-April, the peso has weakened nearly 8%.\par \par \uc2 "We are very satisfied with the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  program and it's coherent with our inflationary objective," De Gregorio told reporters.\par \par \uc2 He added that the bank currently has no plans to increase its purchases and if it did, it would announce it in due course, just like it announced this \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  before it began its daily purchases.\par \par \uc2 To prevent an inflationary expansion in money supply, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is sterilizing the dollar purchases by increasing its local debt issues by $3.0 billion.\par \par \uc2 -By Carolina Pica, Dow Jones Newswires; 56-2-460-8544; carolina.pica@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 (Patricia San Juan contributed to this report.) [ 16-05-08 1518GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020080516e45g000tu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
