\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 3- \highlight22\uc2 Chile \highlight\uc2  peso slumps on  \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention \highlight\uc2  plan\b0\par\par\uc2 By Rodrigo Martinez and Froilan Romero   \par \uc2 578 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 April 2008\par 21:15\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2008 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (Updates with peso close)\par \par \uc2 SANTIAGO, April 11 (Reuters) - The Chilean peso fell 2.8 percent on Friday after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it would buy $8 billion worth of greenbacks this year to curb the sharp appreciation of the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The peso <CHILJ> <CLP=CL> fell as much as 3.7 percent earlier in the session, but recovered some ground later in the day amid profit-taking to close at 446.30/446.80 per dollar.\par \par \uc2 At Thursday's close of 433.80/434.10, the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was up nearly 15 percent against the dollar in 2008, making it one of the strongest performers worldwide against the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The peso is now 11.6 percent firmer against the dollar for the year to date.\par \par \uc2 To stem the rise, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said Thursday night it would step into the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market for the first time since 2002 and purchase $50 million a day in competitive auctions, starting on Monday.\par \par \uc2 As reasons for stepping into the market, it cited risks of fallout from the U.S. subprime crisis, wider global market turbulence, the weak dollar and the need to boost liquidity in the local market. For details, see [ID;nN10415307].\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  President Jose De Gregorio reaffirmed market dynamics would determine the peso's value.\par \par \uc2 "We are not looking for either a floor or a ceiling... The market determines the exchange rate," he told a news conference.\par \par \uc2 "We are not considering capital controls."\par \par \uc2 The peso hit a decade-high of 431.20/431.50 on March 18, the strongest level since late 1997, and stayed close to that level since, sparking a cry from Chilean exporters fearing the loss of their competitive edge worldwide.\par \par \uc2 On Friday, \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 's center-left government welcomed the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which has autonomous status.\par \par \uc2 "The government values the decision ... taken by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to accumulate international reserves," Finance Minister Andres Velasco told a news conference after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said the dollar purchases will boost reserves by around 40 percent from March levels of $17.9 billion.\par \par \uc2 He added: "I am convinced the decision adopted by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will contribute to the competitiveness of the economy and correct this (exchange rate) misalignment."\par \par \uc2 But some analysts were not convinced the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy would have a profound effect.\par \par \uc2 HSBC\uc2  noted the daily auction size looked relatively small.\par \par \uc2 "Fifty million dollars a day is a relatively small sum compared to daily volumes of between $1.5 billion to $2 billion, so the purchases can at best have a psychological effect on the market," it said.\par \par \uc2 But \uc2 Goldman Sachs\uc2  said the size of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was "not trivial" and expected it to contribute to peso weakening.\par \par \uc2 Like some other Wall Street banks, it expressed puzzlement that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  did not introduce the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  as part of a broader monetary policy package that would have included a \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate hike on Thursday night to control inflation. For details, see [IDn:N10230653].\par \par \uc2 "In essence, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is unequivocally extremely concerned with the level of the Chilean peso and has chosen to subordinate the inflation target to the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  objective," \uc2 Goldman Sachs\uc2  analyst Alberto Ramos wrote. (Writing by Simon Gardner; Editing by Jan Paschal)\par \par \uc2 MARKETS-CHILE/PESO (UPDATE 3)|LANGEN|ABN|E|RBN|U|M|D|RNP|DNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020080411e44b001sc\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
