\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Chile \highlight\uc2  Ctrl Bk Announces Market  \highlight22\uc2 Forex Intervention \highlight\uc2  For $8B\b0\par\par\uc2 259 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 April 2008\par 01:33\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2008 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 SANTIAGO (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Thursday announced plans for an $8 billion \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to stop the strong appreciation of the peso against the U.S. dollar.\par \par \uc2 "The Board of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Chile\uc2  has adopted the following measure: to increase the stock of international reserves by $8 billion by purchasing foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  over a period extending from April 14 to December 12, 2008," the bank said in a statement.\par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Chile\uc2  will, in due course, announce the specific purchase programs, which could be modified according to market conditions. The first program, which will run from April 14 to May, will consist of daily purchases of around $50 million via competitive auctions," it added.\par \par \uc2 The Chilean peso has risen more than 12% against the dollar so far this year, reaching 10-year highs in recent weeks. It's strengthened on record prices of copper, the country's main export, and the 4-percentage-point differential between the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's key TPM interest rate and the U.S. federal funds rate.\par \par \uc2 Agricultural exporters, meanwhile, continue to publicly protest against the strong \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . They say their products have lost competitiveness abroad amid a slower world economy. They've called on the government and/or the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to implement peso-weakening measures.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Web site: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.bcentral.cl"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://www.bcentral.cl}}}\par \par \uc2 -By Patricia San Juan, Dow Jones Newswires; 56-2-460-8546; patty.sanjuan@dowjones.com [ 11-04-08 0003GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020080410e44a001ic\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
