\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 3-Chile  \highlight22\uc2 central bank \highlight\uc2  chief says no haste on peso\b0\par\par\uc2 501 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2008\par 23:44\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2008 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (Adds further \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  comment on speculators)\par \par \uc2 SANTIAGO, March 18 (Reuters) - Chilean \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  President Jose De Gregorio said on Tuesday the institution would avoid hasty action to combat the rapid appreciation of the peso against the dollar, but did not discard future \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "Not acting is in itself a monetary policy decision that is justified under present conditions and which can change as local and global economic conditions evolve," De Gregorio told Chile's Lower House, or Chamber of Deputies.\par \par \uc2 Chile's peso is close to an 11-year high against the dollar, buoyed by extended, soaring copper prices and a widening differential between interest rates in \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the United States.\par \par \uc2 "We cannot discard an \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the exchange rate in the event that there is a disalignment that threatens the stability of the economy, in the event where we feel an \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  would be effective," De Gregorio told legislators, who are demanding relief for Chileans suffering from the strong peso.\par \par \uc2 With the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  one of the fastest rising against the dollar this year, legislators demanded action on Tuesday from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  chief and warned that no action could be harmful.\par \par \uc2 "Where is the pilot here," one legislator said ahead of De Gregorio's speech to federal deputies. "We have a serious problem here ... We need a flight plan."\par \par \uc2 The peso has gained more than 14 percent against the dollar this year, among the strongest gains of any Latin American \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  this year against the greenback.\par \par \uc2 Hardest hit by Chile's powerful \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  have been farmers, who export most of their fruits and vegetables to buyers who pay in dollars.\par \par \uc2 With the weaker dollar, the revenues don't go as far as they once did in paying peso-denominated costs like labor.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  <CHILJ><CLP=CL> strengthened 0.60 percent on Tuesday to close at 431.20/431.50 per dollar, compared with the prior session's close at 433.80/434.10.\par \par \uc2 Chile's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has raised its benchmark rate to 6.25 percent to control inflation, while the Fed has lowered rates to try to jump-start the weak economy.\par \par \uc2 The U.S. Federal Reserve slashed U.S. interest rates on Tuesday by three-quarters of a percentage point, taking the benchmark overnight rate down to 2.25 percent, the lowest since February 2005.\par \par \uc2 After nearly three hours of debate with congressmen, De Gregorio said the monetary policy scenario was extremely complex, involving fundamental local and global factors.\par \par \uc2 "We have not discounted any measure, but neither will we encourage speculation among those who are taking positions thinking that in the end the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is going to rescue them, that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," he said in a rebuttal. (Reporting by Pav Jordan, Rodrigo Martinez and Antonio de la Jara; Editing by Andre Grenon/Jeffrey Benkoe)\par \par \uc2 CHILE-CENBANK/ (UPDATE 3)|LANGEN|ABN|E|U|RBN|D|M|RNP|DNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020080318e43i001p3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
