\par\par \b \uc2 ANALYSIS- \highlight22\uc2 Chile \highlight\uc2 's peso seen stronger,  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  eyed  \b0\par\par\uc2 By Antonio de la Jara  \par \uc2 800 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 April 2006\par 19:48\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2006 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 SANTIAGO, \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 , April 12 (Reuters) - At the rate \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 's peso is rising, it could soon reach its strongest against the dollar in more than six years and could even prompt the usually hands-off government to weaken the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  through market \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 Boosted by record high copper prices, \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 's peso briefly hit 510.70 per dollar on Wednesday, a level not seen since December, and traders said that if it crosses the 510 per dollar mark, there was no telling how strong it could get.  \par \par \uc2 "We feel it could fall below 500 pesos in coming weeks, driven mostly by the price of copper and a good scenario abroad," said Cristian Gardeweg, an economist with the Celfin investment bank.  \par \par \uc2 The 500 pesos per dollar rate is seen as a key psychological level that could possibly trigger the government to act, economists said.  \par \par \uc2 Copper prices are soaring as global demand for the metal, which is used in everything from electrical wiring to water piping and as a heat conductor, continues to build, and as investment funds increase exposure to commodities.  \par \par \uc2 Chile is the world's largest producer of the metal and the government receives tax dollars from the giant foreign mining firms and billions of dollars of profit from No. 1 copper miner, state-owned Codelco.  \par \par \uc2 U.S. copper futures extended their bull run early Wednesday with benchmark May copper <HGK6> trading at $2.75 a lb, up more than 30 percent this year, and compared with about 60 cents a lb a few years ago.  \par \par \uc2 The peso, which fell early in the year, has strengthened again in recent weeks and analysts say the momentum it is gathering could lend it a strength not seen since 2000.  \par \par \uc2 "I believe it is very probable that copper prices will stay high until close to the end of the year," said Ricardo Amorin, head of Latin American research at WestLB in New York.  \par \par \uc2 "So we see (the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) touching 500 pesos per dollar, which is very possible because, really, its pretty close already, about 3 percent away."  \par \par \uc2 And while the high price of copper has fattened miners' profits, the resulting strong peso has hit fruit growers, wine exporters and others who say it makes it hard for them to compete on the global market and have for months been asking the government to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2  has a free-floating \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  but the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  can \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  if it sees speculative bubbles or other dangers in the market.  \par \par \uc2 "The dollar will be fluctuating in a range between 510 and 530 pesos, depending on the \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  that some political authorities make, trying to maintain the exchange rate," said Franco Parisi, economist with the University of \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 Economists said that the political cost of not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  could be high, especially since the new government of Michelle Bachelet has promised to help small and medium-sized businesses, such as the exporters who say they are being battered by the super-peso.  \par \par \uc2 "If the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  does not do anything and doesn't care, there will be a moment in which the exchange rate will be less than 500 pesos per dollar," said Eduardo Orpis, economist with Finanzas Today consulting firm, who thinks there will be a lot of pressure on the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 Other than \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  by buying pesos, economists say the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  or finance ministry could issue dollar-denominated debt to increase dollar demand, stimulate dollar demand by allowing the country's private pension funds to invest more abroad, or make offshore investments of Codelco's dollar-denominated revenue to keep the dollars out of the Chilean \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.  \par \par \uc2 Up until now officials have limited themselves to occasional verbal messages to the market that have had some effect, and economists said they expect more of that.  \par \par \uc2 "It's very likely that in the next days and weeks we'll see more than a few verbal \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  or declarations, although the usefulness of that has almost been used up," said Angel Cabrera, economist with Forecast consulting firm in Santiago.  \par \par \uc2 Chile's record trade surplus of $2.198 billion in March, also pushed up by high copper prices, gives little room for the peso to turn, economists said.  \par \par \uc2 "We expect something similar in April (for the trade surplus) and the truth is that given the external accounts there is no where the exchange rate can devalue," Orpis said.  \par \par \uc2 The peso appreciation could also get more fuel on Thursday if the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  hikes the benchmark interest rate to 5.0 percent, as expected, economists said. (Additional reporting by Maria Jose Latorre and Manuel Farias)  \par \par \uc2 ECONOMY-CHILE-\b \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCY\b0 \highlight\uc2  (ANALYSIS)|LANGEN|ABN|E|RBN|D|M|C|GRO|MTL|SOF  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020060415e24c000cb\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
