\par\par \b \uc2 Chile peso falls sharply on February CPI data  \b0\par\par\uc2 289 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2006\par 19:02\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2006 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 SANTIAGO, Chile, March 3 (Reuters) - The Chilean peso fell sharply on Friday after news that the consumer price index unexpectedly fell 0.1 percent in February, raising doubts the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will boost interest rates next week.  \par \par \uc2 The peso <CHILJ> <CLP=CL> fell 0.77 percent to 523.20/523.70 per dollar from Thursday's 519.70/520.20 close.  \par \par \uc2 A Reuters survey of 11 economists yielded a median forecast rise of 0.1 percent in the February CPI. The surprise decline in prices reported by the National Statistics Institute brought 12-month inflation as of the end of February to 4.1 percent.  \par \par \uc2 "There are two important factors pressuring the peso. Today there was the surprising deflation in February," a trader said. "Plus, there have been statements by authorities indicating that measures could be taken to keep the peso from making further gains against the dollar."  \par \par \uc2 The peso also fell on Thursday after outgoing President Ricardo Lagos said that if the dollar continued trending down, the administration of President-elect Michelle Bachelet, who takes office on March 11, may have to work with the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to find a way to revive the flagging greenback.  \par \par \uc2 A huge rally in prices for copper, Chile's most important export product, gave the nation a record budget surplus in 2005, and put downward pressure on the dollar, which fell 8.5 percent against the peso last year.  \par \par \uc2 Many exporters have been calling for \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  measures to weaken the peso against the dollar, but up until now authorities have maintained a hands-off policy regarding \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-\b \highlight22\uc2 CHILE\b0 \highlight\uc2 -PESO|LANGEN|ABN|E|RBN|M|D|U|RNP|DNP  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020060303e233001lz\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
