\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Chile \highlight\uc2  Fin Min:Not Opposed To  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  To Boost Dollar  \b0\par\par\uc2 478 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 November 2005\par 22:37\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 SANTIAGO (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 's Finance Minister isn't opposed in principle to an \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to boost the dollar, he told reporters Wednesday.  \par \par \uc2 "I'm not opposed to an \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in cold blood, but I am opposed to an \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 " for a prolonged period, Eyzaguirre said after a meeting with President Ricardo Lagos.  \par \par \uc2 While the government has some fiscal means at its disposal to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has greater room to do so, he added.  \par \par \uc2 The peso set a 66-month record against the dollar earlier, ending at CLP516.00 to the dollar compared with CLP518.85 Tuesday, after trading in a CLP515.35-CLP520.60 range.  \par \par \uc2 Exporters have pressured authorities - above all the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the finance ministry - to prop up the faltering greenback.  \par \par \uc2 However, the Chilean peso hasn't lost contact with underlying fundamentals - the record price of copper and the global weakness of the dollar - in continually setting over five-year records against the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Jose de Gregorio, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's vice president said earlier Wednesday.  \par \par \uc2 The bank has said it will only due so in the event of an imbalance such as major speculation.  \par \par \uc2 Twice in the past three years, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has threatened to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  and provided dollar liquidity when the peso weakened sharply against the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 Both de Gregorio and Eyzaguirre spoke against a \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate target for the peso, and both said the peso will likely weaken once copper prices retreat from their current record levels around $2 per pound.  \par \par \uc2 Chile is the world's number-one copper producer.  \par \par \uc2 Considering copper prices are expected to drop, the market should adjust the peso's \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate, not the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  through \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , de Gregorio said.  \par \par \uc2 The last times the independent \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  stepped into the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  arena, it announced by how much it would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in dollar terms.  \par \par \uc2 However, Eyzaguirre disagreed with that policy. "The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  that I think can be done is unpredictable and therefore the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  should never reveal what it's going to do" in order to weaken speculators' positions, he said.  \par \par \uc2 Under current conditions, businesses subject to \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  fluctuations need to improve forward coverage, he added.  \par \par \uc2 "Just as I warned exporters when the dollar was at CLP630 to cover their future exports and not complain later, now I tell importers and those who have debts in dollars that it's a good moment to cover them because I*m not certain this price of copper will last and that the dollar will stay at these levels," he said.  \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Web site  {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.bcentral.cl"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://www.bcentral.cl }}}\par \par \uc2 -By Stephan Kueffner, Dow Jones Newswires; +562-460-8547; stephan.kueffner@dowjones.com  \par \par \uc2 (Patricia San Juan contributed to this report) [ 30-11-05 2137GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020051130e1bu0012b\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
