\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Chile central bank \highlight\uc2  sees no peso  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  need  \b0\par\par\uc2 283 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 November 2005\par 16:45\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 SANTIAGO, \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Nov 21 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has not seen the need to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market despite a major rally in the peso \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the bank's vice president, Jose de Gregorio, said on Monday.  \par \par \uc2 The peso is trading at close to five-year highs against the dollar, pumped up by the global copper rally. Non-minerals exporters are pressing the government to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to curb the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's strength, which they contend is eroding their competitiveness abroad.  \par \par \uc2 Chile has had a free-floating \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  system since September 1999 but the bank can \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in special cases.  \par \par \uc2 "We have a flexible exchange rate policy whereby under special circumstances we can evaluate whether it is necessary to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but that situation has not occurred," De Gregorio told reporters.  \par \par \uc2 "Many times \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  are ineffective in the medium term and even in the short term, and a lot of this depends on what is" happening in the market, De Gregorio said.  \par \par \uc2 Last Thursday, Finance Minister Nicolas Eyzaguirre said that if officials saw signs of speculating in the market, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  could \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but he said there was no sign of a speculative bubble so far.  \par \par \uc2 The peso has appreciated in recent weeks due to record high prices for copper, Chile's main export. Voracious Chinese demand for the metal has pumped up prices.  \par \par \uc2 The peso <CHILJ> <CLP=CL> was trading at 525.70/526.00 per dollar at midday on Monday (1500 GMT). The peso hit a five-year closing high of 523.50 on Nov. 15.  \par \par \uc2 ECONOMY-CHILE-PESO|LANGEN|ABN|D|M  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020051121e1bl001ic\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
