l bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  25-basis-point interest rate hike, to 2.50%, at its monthly monetary policy meeting scheduled for Thursday.  \par \par \uc2 The 20-year PRC closed at a yield of 3.32%, compared with 3.30% Friday.  \par \par \uc2 -By Carolina Pica, Dow Jones Newswires; +56 2 460 8544 carolina.pica@dowjones.com  \par \par \uc2 (Patricia San Juan contributed to this report) [ 06-12-04 1712GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 1170 1844  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020041206e0c6000se\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
