\par\par \b \uc2 Chilean Peso Weakens On Rumor ECB Mulling  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 273 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 Februar 2004\par 19:19\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 SANTIAGO (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 's peso ended weaker Wednesday, dropping in line with the euro following speculation that the European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is considering \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in favor of the dollar, traders said.  \par \par \uc2 The Andean \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  closed at CLP589.40 to the dollar from CLP585.50 after trading in a CLP585.50-590.00 range.  \par \par \uc2 Traders overseas said the move was triggered in part by a report from the Market News service, which cited unnamed sources from the ECB as saying the bank was prepared to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets in concert with the Bank of Japan to weaken the euro.  \par \par \uc2 The peso has latched on to the euro in recent weeks, decoupling from copper, Chile's soaring top export product.  \par \par \uc2 Copper's hold on the peso has lessened after Finance Minister Nicolas Eyzaguirre said the windfall from high copper prices, which have reached eight-year highs and spiked another 3.2% Wednesday, will be used to prepay debt, easing fears of a flood of dollars in the local market, traders said.  \par \par \uc2 U.S. Federal Reserve Chairman Alan Greenspan's positive comments on the U.S. economy and calmness about foreign Treasurys holdings also undermined the peso, traders added.  \par \par \uc2 However, the peso may well be headed for turbulence depending on the strength or weakness of the dollar in upcoming trading, they also said. In broad terms, the peso should stay within its CLP569-595 recent range, traders said.  \par \par \uc2 -By Stephan Kueffner, Dow Jones Newswires; +562-460-8546; stephan.kueffner@dowjones.com  \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    (Patricia San Juan contributed to this report) \par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 [ 25-02-04 1819GMT ]  \f28 \par \par \uc2 1170 1844  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020040225e02p000vt\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
