\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Chile \highlight\uc2  Peso Ends Weaker On  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Fear, Euro  \b0\par\par\uc2 265 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 Januar 2004\par 21:48\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 SANTIAGO (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 's peso weakened against the dollar for the fifth straight session Friday, with fears of a \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the decline of the euro weighing on the market, according to traders.  \par \par \uc2 The local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  weakened to CLP574.10 to the dollar from CLP573.80 Thursday. However, its sharpest decline came early and the peso gradually recouped much of that decline as the market tried to feel the ceiling, traders said.  \par \par \uc2 While the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has adamantly ruled out \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  at this time as it doesn't consider the peso overvalued, guessing about where the bank might see the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  as too strong pressured the peso early, traders added.  \par \par \uc2 Additionally, concern that the Group of Seven leading industrialized nations might launch into coordinated action to stem the dollar's fall also weighed on the peso after the recent slew of more hawkish statements by European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  officials, they added.  \par \par \uc2 Along with other commodity-based \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the peso has appreciated sharply in recent months, helped primarily by the rise in copper prices and a positive outlook for the Chilean economy. It has also latched onto the euro amid the global weakening of the dollar.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  doesn't target the peso as such, but it has left the door open to do so in the event of an emergency, as when the peso plunged to record lows ahead of the Argentina crisis and the Iraq war.  \par \par \uc2 -By Stephan Kueffner, Dow Jones Newswires; 562-460-8546; stephan.kueffner@dowjones.com  \par \par \uc2 1170 1844  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020040116e01g000ru\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
