\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 2- \highlight22\uc2 Chile \highlight\uc2  Cenbank says to  \highlight22\uc2 intervene \highlight\uc2  on peso if needed.   \b0\par\par\uc2 497 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Januar 2004\par 22:49\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 SANTIAGO, \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Jan 15 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Thursday it was prepared to take measures to halt a sharp appreciation in the peso against the U.S. dollar but was still not convinced this was necessary.   \par \par \uc2 The peso appreciated 21 percent in 2003 and firmed to 39-month highs last Friday, buoyed by rising prices of its principal export, copper; a good outlook for the domestic and global economies; and the weakness of the dollar against other foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 .   \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  President Vittorio Corbo told a business meeting the peso \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was not "out of its orbit" and was trading within stable margins. He dismissed exporter concerns, saying that the peso was at the same level it was at three years ago.   \par \par \uc2 "No \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  rules out the possibility of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. If tomorrow we see the necessity to do it we will," Corbo said.   \par \par \uc2 "We will act when the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  board is convinced this is necessary ... and we're not convinced yet," Corbo said.   \par \par \uc2 The rise in the peso has caused concern among exporters their profits will be hurt and sparked debate among economists and some government authorities who believe the bank should step in now.   \par \par \uc2 A special committee of private exporters called on the government on Thursday to begin a discussion about ways to ensure less volatility in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.   \par \par \uc2 Though they emphasized they were not lobbying for a fixed or ideal peso value against the dollar, they said the strengthening peso in recent months was affecting potential future investments and job creation for many exporters.   \par \par \uc2 "We are in a position only to express our concern to the authorities and to public opinion about this process. These abrupt appreciations have worrying consequences," said committee president Andres Concha.   \par \par \uc2 Seventy-five percent of Chilean exports are directly or indirectly linked to the dollar, the committee said.   \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has said it will wait for the market to stabilize the peso.   \par \par \uc2 After the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  cut interest rates last Thursday to a historic low of 1.75 percent, the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has depreciated somewhat this week and closed down 0.10 percent at 573.80/574.30 on Thursday.   \par \par \uc2 But traders said they expect fresh gains in the peso in the next few days.   \par \par \uc2 "It's most likely that the drop in the peso is a temporary situation that should reverse itself starting tomorrow (Friday), as long as demand subsides," said Patricio Mella, trader at Inversiones J.C. Tour.   \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  last \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  directly in the foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in October 2002, when the peso fell to a historic low of 760 per dollar amid political jitters in Brazil.   \par \par \uc2 The bank on Wednesday raised its forecast for economic growth for 2004 to between 4.5 percent and 5.5 percent from between 4 percent and 5 percent, citing stronger prices for its principal exports, namely copper.    \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020040115e01f003vz\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
