\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Chile Central Bank \highlight\uc2  denies  \highlight22\uc2 forex intervention \highlight\uc2 .  \b0\par\par\uc2 295 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 November 2003\par 15:42\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 SANTIAGO, \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Nov 6 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Thursday it was not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market even though the peso weakened in reaction to its decision to swap its "exchange-rate" bonds for dollar-denominated ones.  \par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2 , it is neutral. The market will gradually digest the information and then we'll see (what happens)," \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  President Vittorio Corbo told reporters.  \par \par \uc2 The bank said late Wednesday it will no longer renew every month all of its so-called exchange-rate bonds, which have a face value in dollars but are paid back in pesos according to the exchange rate at time of maturity.  \par \par \uc2 The market interpreted the move as a withdrawal of dollars from the market to slow down a sharp appreciation of the peso .  \par \par \uc2 The peso, which has strengthened by over 12 percent against the dollar this year, lost 0.29 percent in mid-morning trade to 629.80/630.30 per dollar compared with Wednesday's close of 628.00/628.50.  \par \par \uc2 "The market acts day by day and adjusts itself. The information we announced yesterday is neutral with respect to the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market," Corbo added.  \par \par \uc2 The move aims to reduce the cost of financing \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  debt but would not change its net foreign reserves position or its policy of a free-floating \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the bank said on Wednesday.  \par \par \uc2 Markets remained cautious despite remarks by Corbo and analysts that the measure should have no impact on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 "Even if they've said the measure shouldn't affect the exchange rate, the market is still studying it and its first reaction is to go out and buy dollars as a precautionary measure," said one trader.   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020031106dzb6003fl\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
