\par\par \b \uc2 Strong  \highlight22\uc2 Chile \highlight\uc2  Peso No Reason To  \highlight22\uc2 Intervene \highlight\uc2 -Ctrl Bk Official  \b0\par\par\uc2 279 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 Oktober 2003\par 21:33\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 SANTIAGO (Dow Jones)--The strength of the Chilean peso is no reason to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, a \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  official said Wednesday.  \par \par \uc2 "There are no exceptional conditions that would justify some kind of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 " in the peso's recent surge against the dollar, said Esteban Jadresic during a conference call with analysts.  \par \par \uc2 As director of the \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2 's international division, Jadresic oversees daily \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  moves.  \par \par \uc2 The Banco Central policy on the floating peso is to only \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  under exceptional circumstances, as when the peso weakened sharply against the dollar in late 2001 and again in late 2002.  \par \par \uc2 This year, it has appreciated more than 10% against the dollar following a weak spell due to the Iraq crisis. Since then, it has recovered, helped by the recovery in world market copper prices to long-term average levels and prospects of faster growth in Chile. Every cent copper gains translates into some $100 million in additional dollar inflows to Chile.  \par \par \uc2 The peso closed Wednesday at CLP638.70 following copper's rise to above 90 cents per pound on the London Metals Exchange.  \par \par \uc2 Jadresic didn't say whether the bank would extend its policy of issuing dollar-denominated bonds, which strengthen the peso by adding dollar liquidity in the market.  \par \par \uc2 He said long-term interest rates are rising in Chile, another factor that supports the peso.  \par \par \uc2 However, traders said the peso is unlikely to strengthen much in the next few sessions until it's clear whether the bank will continue to issue debt in dollars.  \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    -By Stephan Kueffner, Dow Jones Newswires; 562-460-8546; stephan.kueffner@dowjones.com \par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020031022dzam00159\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
