ess volatile," Pina said. \par \par \uc2  Traders said they expect the peso to continue to strengthen in the short term. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020021022dyam00ztw\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
