\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Chile \highlight\uc2  peso firms amid talk of CenBank  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 250 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 Oktober 2002\par 20:10\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2002 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  SANTIAGO, \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Oct 21 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 's peso rose on Monday amid thin trade as foreign traders, wary of a potential \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , sold dollars they had stocked up over recent weeks, traders said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  closed at 737.50/738.00, an appreciation of 0.83 percent compared to 743.70/744.20. \par \par \uc2  "Last week we saw a drop in trading volumes in the market and this continued on Monday, only this time there was a greater supply of dollars," said Patricio Mella, trader with Inversiones J.C.Tour. \par \par \uc2  Chile's peso fell to historic lows over recent weeks, pressured by political and economic uncertainty in Brazil, whose financial markets are seen as a benchmark for the region, and what the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  called "excessive speculation" with the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  from foreign and local brokers. \par \par \uc2  Analysts commented that movement in the exchange rate had been limited last week since the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it might \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  if the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  fell too low. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on October 10, after the peso fell to an all-time low of 760.50/761.00, it would inject up to $2 billion in dollar-denominated bonds over the next four years and sell $2 billion from its reserves to prop up the peso when necessary. \par \par \uc2  "It seems the measures announced by the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  ended the speculation but also reduced trading volumes as the market has been very quiet since then," Mella added. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020021021dyal010f6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
