\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Chile \highlight\uc2  peso holds steady as market eyes  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 209 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 Oktober 2002\par 20:57\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2002 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  SANTIAGO, \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Oct 17 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 's peso was little changed in slow trade on Thursday and the possibility of a \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was keeping the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  from losing ground, traders said. \par \par \uc2  The peso closed at 745.70/746.20, up 0.08 percent from 746.30/746.80 on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  Chile's \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  last week abandoned its hands-off approach to the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market after the peso hit a historic low of 760.50/761.00, partly on the political uncertainty in Brazil. \par \par \uc2  The bank said it would inject up to $2 billion in dollar-denominated bonds over the next four months and sell $2 billion from its reserves to prop up the peso when necessary. \par \par \uc2  "I think movement in the exchange rate is limited because the market has fixed a ceiling near 750 pesos and fears that the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  if it reaches those levels," said Cristian Gardeweg, analyst at Santander Investment Chile. \par \par \uc2  The peso hit fresh lows over recent weeks on what the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  called excessive speculation from banks and pressure from the rapid depreciation of the Brazilian real \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  . \par \par \uc2  Brazil's financial markets are seen as a benchmark for the regional economy. \par \par \uc2 Dok