\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Chile \highlight\uc2 's Peso Seen With CLP750/$ Floor On  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2  By Stephan Kueffner \par \uc2 488 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 Oktober 2002\par 18:15\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2002, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Of DOW JONES NEWSWIRES \par \par \uc2  SANTIAGO -(Dow Jones)- \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 's peso recovered from historic lows early Friday and is expected to find stability at around CLP750 to the dollar, after the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to prop up the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  late Thursday said it would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  with a total of up to $2.00 billion in dollar-denominated "BCD" bonds and $2.00 billion in cash to support the sagging local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "The BCD auctions provide more liquidity, but alone it won't be enough to put a ceiling on the market. The (dollar's) ceiling will be determined by the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  when it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  directly in the market," said Roberto Telias, head trader at Banco de Chile. \par \par \uc2  Thursday, the peso finished at CLP760.50 a dollar versus CLP751.40 Wednesday, falling to an intraday all-time low of CLP760.80. \par \par \uc2  In early trading Friday, it regained some ground, and at 1610 GMT traded at CLP744.80. The local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  had reached an intraday high of CLP738 shortly after trading began. \par \par \uc2  "I think the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  somewhere near the CLP750 mark," putting a floor under the peso around that level, Donoso said. \par \par \uc2  Uncertainty surrounding Brazil's presidential elections and doubts about that country's ability to meet its debt-financing needs have been affecting markets across the region. The situation is likely to remain volatile as the crisis in confidence affecting Brazil could limit its ability to roll over debt due ahead of the Oct. 27 presidential runoff. \par \par \uc2  Brazil's political situation has been weighing on markets for months because of the popularity of leftist candidate Luiz Inacio Lula da Silva, who appears poised to win. \par \par \uc2  The peso has also been hit by the combination of low copper and high oil prices. \par \par \uc2  While the sluggish global economy has lessened demand for copper, Chile's prime export dollar earner, the U.S.-Iraq crisis has pushed oil prices up, which is detrimental to Chile's terms of trade as the country imports much of its oil. \par \par \uc2  Additionally, the Chilean \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's hesitancy to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  has undermined the peso, traders have said. The peso has lost nearly 15% of its value this year. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had earlier said the peso's fall was justified by economic fundamentals and that it would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  only under exceptional circumstances. \par \par \uc2  In its statement late Thursday, it said that "Part of the depreciation observed recently reflects movements in a market that has operated with little liquidity and high volatility, and, therefore, overreacting to some degree." \par \par \uc2  Chile's foreign reserves have been relatively stable this year, in the $14.50-15.20 billion range. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central Bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Web site: \f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.bcentral.cl"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://www.bcentral.cl}}}\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -By Stephan Kueffner, Dow Jones Newswires; 562-460-8546;\par stephan.kueffner@dowjones.com\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (Patricia San Juan contributed to this report)\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020021011dyab000z2\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
