\par\par \b \uc2  Chile peso recovers ground on CenBank measures. \b0\par\par\uc2 232 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 Oktober 2002\par 21:47\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2002 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  SANTIAGO, Chile, Oct 11 (Reuters) - Chile's peso rose on Friday, pulling back from historic lows and boosted by \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  plans to inject up to $4 billion into the flailing \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, traders said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  closed at 747.00/747.50, up 1.8 percent after hitting an all time low of 760.50/761.00 on Thursday, dragged down by the closely-watched Brazilian real . \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said late on Thursday it would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to prop up the peso by placing dollar bonds of up to $2 billion in the market over the next four months and selling $2 billion in international reserves on the market when it sees necessary. \par \par \uc2  "The role of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is to act with international reserves at times when it sees the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate is either too under or over valued," Economy Minister Jorge Rodriguez told journalists on Friday. \par \par \uc2  The Brazilian real, seen as a benchmark for the region, has lost more than 40 percent of its value in recent months on fears that leftist candidate "Lula" may become the next president and be unable to manage the country's $260 billion public debt. \par \par \uc2  The uncertainty has had a negative impact on Chilean financial markets. \par \par \uc2  At Thursday's close Chile's peso was 15.3 percent below where it started the year. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020021011dyab011i2\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\pi