\par\par \b \uc2  Chile's Massad Warns Of Downside Risk To GDP Forecasts \b0\par\par\uc2  By Mike Esterl \par \uc2 790 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 Oktober 2002\par 18:18\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2002, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Of DOW JONES NEWSWIRES \par \par \uc2  NEW YORK -(Dow Jones)- Chilean \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Carlos Massad said Tuesday there is a downside risk to the country's economic growth forecasts, given the shaky environment globally and in its own backyard. \par \par \uc2  "We judge the bias to be downward," said Massad in a speech at the Council of Americas in New York. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has already revised downward its 2002 economic growth forecast to the 2.0% to 2.5% range, as much of the global economy sputters and financial shock waves emanate from Argentina and Brazil, its two larger South American neighbors. \par \par \uc2  Chile's economy is one of the most outward looking in the world, with exports of goods and services comprising an estimated 36% of gross domestic product. During the 1990s, it routinely booked 5%-plus GDP growth. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is forecasting tentatively that GDP will grow between 3.5% and 4.5% in 2003 and 5% in 2004, but Massad acknowledged he wasn't heartened by the mood at the annual meetings of the International Monetary Fund in Washington this past weekend. \par \par \uc2  "As the meetings went on, the question marks were bigger and bigger," he said in reference to the global economic outlook. \par \par \uc2  The IMF is projecting Latin American GDP will contract 0.6% this year, despite pockets of growth in a handful of countries, including Chile. \par \par \uc2  The slowdown in the world and regional economy has pushed prices for copper, Chile's single-largest export, down to around $0.67 a pound, "the lowest we've had since 1934" in real terms, according to the central banker. \par \par \uc2  Regional turmoil isn't helping matters. Massad estimated that the travails of Argentina, where the economy is expected to contract around 15% in the wake of last December's debt default, have probably had a negative impact of half a percentage point on Chile's GDP. \par \par \uc2  Market upheaval in Brazil this year ahead of presidential elections has probably had a negative impact of only around 0.2 or 0.3 percentage point of GDP, according to the central banker, who pointed out that Chilean corporate investments in Brazil are only about half as big as in Argentina. \par \par \uc2  But he admitted that his country is vulnerable to a continued market sell-off in Brazil, which has seen its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  weaken around 40% and bond spreads widen more than 1500 basis points this year amid growing fears that it too may be headed to default. \par \par \uc2  "The main risk," Massad warned, is that a Brazilian crisis might "weaken the capacity of the markets to discriminate the situations of different countries." \par \par \uc2  Chile is South America's last remaining investment-grade credit, after ratings agencies demoted Uruguay to junk status as contagion from Argentina and Brazil overwhelmed the tiny country. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Forex Intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Only In `Extraordinary' Case\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Chile\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's markets have been feeling some heat in recent weeks, with the\par peso weakening to CLP748.80 to the dollar Monday, a new record closing\par low and down 8.3% from the end of June.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "We are looking closely at what's going on with the peso rate," said\par Massad, adding that the bank's international reserves, at around $15\par billion, are available to \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market if\par necessary.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par But he also suggested that he wasn't overly concerned with the current\par exchange rate, and that \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  would require more than the peso\par weakening only against the greenback, given the country's diversified\par export markets.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "For \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to be justified, we have to consider that the\par situation is extraordinary, that is, that the peso is not moving with\par the rest of the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , but that it has taken a loss by itself,"\par said Massad, adding that this hasn't been the case until now.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par He also noted that a weaker peso helps the export sector, which, along\par with construction, is the main driver of the Chilean economy.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par And unlike Argentina and Brazil, which are saddled with heavy\par dollar-linked debt obligations, a weakening local \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  actually\par eases fiscal pressures in Chile, given that the government only has $7\par billion in foreign debt, Massad added.\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Chile\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  last \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market last year, in the\par wake of the Sept. 11 terrorist attacks on the U.S. that sent financial\par markets reeling.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Massad said he felt comfortable that Chile will be able to meet its 3%\par inflation target this year. He pointed out that yields on domestic debt\par indicate that the market also believes annual inflation will be around\par 3%, not just this year, but over the next five years.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -By Mike Esterl, Dow Jones Newswires; 201-938-4026;\par mike.esterl@dowjones.com\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020021001dya1000zw\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
