\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Chile \highlight\uc2  peso firms, cenbank says no  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  yet. \b0\par\par\uc2 249 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 Oktober 2002\par 22:02\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2002 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  SANTIAGO, \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Oct 1 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 's weakened peso strengthened slightly on Tuesday, following movements in the Brazilian real, while the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  rejected the possibility of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  for now. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  closed at 745.20/745.70, a depreciation of 0.48 percent compared to 748.80/749.30 on Monday. \par \par \uc2  "For \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to be justified, we have to consider the situation to be extraordinary, that the peso is not moving with the rest of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but that it is taking a loss by itself," \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  President Carlos Massad told a meeting hosted by the America's Society in New York. \par \par \uc2  Chile's peso has lost more than 11 percent of its value this year. In recent weeks, it has hit record lows, pressured by the possibility of U.S. military action in Iraq and heavy losses in the Brazilian real. \par \par \uc2  The real \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  firmed 4 percent to 3.61 per dollar after an early slide. The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has lost 38 percent of its value since the beginning of the year, mainly on investor jitters that leftist presidential candidate Luiz Inacio Lula da Silva could win on the Oct. 6 election but be incapable of managing the country's economy and $260 billion public debt. \par \par \uc2  Nonetheless, Lula predicted on Tuesday the real would rebound 30 percent soon after Sunday's first round vote. \par \par \uc2  Brazil's financial markets are seen as a barometer of investor sentiment in Latin America. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020021001dya1012fd\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
