\par\par \b \uc2  Chilean peso tumbles, cenbank won't  \highlight22\uc2 intervene \highlight\uc2  now. \b0\par\par\uc2 274 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 August 2002\par 21:48\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2002 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  SANTIAGO, \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Aug 28 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 's peso tumbled almost 1 percent on Wednesday, creeping toward historic lows, but the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  ruled out \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  for now to defend the flagging \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  closed at 716.00/716.50, a depreciation of 0.94 percent compared to 709.30/709.80 on Tuesday and at its lowest since October 2001 as region-wary foreign banks stocked up on safe-haven dollars, traders said. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  chief Carlos Massad said he would leave the market to correct itself but left the door open to future \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  if necessary. \par \par \uc2  "The peso is falling due to foreign factors, meaning we have to leave it to correct itself," Massad said in an interview with local radio Chile Solo Noticias. \par \par \uc2  "Naturally, if there are extraordinary circumstances, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has always reserved the right to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  like it did last year but so far those circumstances haven't arisen," he added. \par \par \uc2  Traders noted a strong demand for dollars over recent days from foreign banks operating in Chile which fear contagion of the Chilean economy from its financially troubled neighbors Argentina and Brazil. \par \par \uc2  Finance Minister Nicolas Eyzaguirre commented, "The fall in the peso is natural in a flexible market economy when there is \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  weakness in other countries." \par \par \uc2  "It's the way an economy defends itself against eventual competitiveness from countries which may have a very weak exchange rate," Eyzaguirre said. \par \par \uc2  Chile's peso, which last year weakened about 14 percent due to the Argentine crisis, has been under pressure more recently from investor jitters over Brazil's October presidential elections. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020020828dy8s012kz\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (foreign exchange or fx or forex or currenc*) and (interven* or operation*) and (chile near10 interven*) and (rst=trtw or rst=tprw or rst=tdjw)and (central bank or ministry of finance or treasury ministry or monetary authority) \cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Datum\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 01/01/1995 bis 21/08/2023\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\c